# Bloodmoon "To Catch a Thief", Falco's side: Falco suspects Uryn Maren of
# stealing ore and gives the player his key. The chest is empty (CO_6 30,
# ColonyChestMaryn); the player then trails Uryn through the mine. Uryn
# sneaks along a chain of AiTravels (ColonyUryn) and, at the end, logs the
# catch when the player is within 512 units (50). Uryn explains, and Falco and
# Carnius close it (80, ColonyState 9). PositionCell skips the locked door.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_co_supply_route --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case co_thief
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask assignment
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 10
ask Uryn Maren
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 20
bye
run
player->PositionCell 250 54 40 0 "Raven Rock, Uryn Maren's House"
activate 06630511
close ContainerMenu
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 30
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask Uryn Maren
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 40
bye
run
player->PositionCell 2438 1100 12900 0 "Raven Rock, Mine"
follow Uryn Maren
until 1800 GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 50
follow
talk Uryn Maren
ask explanation
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 60
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask Uryn Maren
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 65
bye
run
player->PositionCell 3504 4553 16407 0 "Fort Frostmoth, Imperial Cult Shrine"
until 600 "Carnius Magius"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Carnius Magius
ask Uryn Maren
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 70
bye
run
player->Position -197200 160250 870 0
until 600 "Falco Galenus"->GetDistance player < 400
talk Falco Galenus
ask Uryn Maren
expect GetJournalIndex CO_6 == 80
expect ColonyState == 9
bye
end
